{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-store/src/tags.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T05:11:03.781792Z","id":"c9cd2dc9a668f4b36a8db762ba3aaa63a0efe2f8027ccbd48591caef8c733942","body":{"detail":"The tag.delete record names the tag and how many live artifacts carried it (artifacts), not which. An artifact's own history (toolpath export per artifact) therefore does not show that it lost the tag. Accepted: tags are owner metadata, and one record per delete keeps a busy tag's delete one write.","kind":"waiver","span":{"start":{"line":298},"end":{"line":316},"content_hash":"8a836e4d1bdfbd7d939a8c18b77543b4510334dcb30ab4b37040a7b80b2c0157"},"summary":"Deleting a tag records one tag.delete, not an artifact.update for each artifact that loses it","supersedes":"b9b1153b9975702077af3b1164277e568ffc87263d9741786c7d5c353b866e38","tags":["session:claude-code:d1f51555-8e8f-4c11-acd6-673f773ac34d"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-store/src/backfill.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:36:39.663674Z","id":"9c8e7a8631870ee873167d78f4d3788bc66b42f9ef497eacebe479da099ab1de","body":{"detail":"Failure: in CI runs 39440289806, 39352509329, 39283609761 and 39266520838 (ci.yml on main, 2026-10-19/20) it panicked at line 2420 with 3.83 s and 3.86 s of CPU. AGENTS.md asks for no wall-clock budgets in checks and for performance to be measured on demand (just perf). Its failure also fails tests::the_store_tests_pass_on_one_connection (crates/clax-store/src/lib.rs:897), which reruns the suite on one connection.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":2408},"end":{"line":2421},"content_hash":"c22de098aa9cee0dadd117a1aaade941801d6312b96bb9cabe5ad23f3e18a07b"},"suggested_fix":"Keep the event count assertion and move the CPU budget to just perf.","summary":"backfill_on_perf_seed_under_3s is a 3 s CPU budget and fails CI on main","tags":["flaky","tests","session:claude-code:d1f51555-8e8f-4c11-acd6-673f773ac34d"]}}
